{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"relation\": \"还说不清\",\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S01-1\",\n      \"text\": \"他心里有股不肯就此算了的劲，却连自己在等什么、该往哪儿去都说不清，整个人都没着落。\",\n      \"key\": \"不肯就此算了\",\n      \"follows\": false,\n      \"explains\": [\"B2\", \"B3\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S01-2\",\n      \"text\": \"他逼自己撑住，也想停一停，真要投入时又怕丢下舍不得的东西。\",\n      \"key\": \"丢下舍不得的东西\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B5\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S01-3\",\n      \"text\": \"他反复找理由压过不舍，好让自己敢往前，可刚觉得能信，不舍又让他退回去，也为自己非得想透才肯走而难堪。\",\n      \"key\": \"非得想透才肯走\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\", \"B2\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S01-4\",\n      \"text\": \"先前说不清的舍不得忽然显得熟悉，他像快认出自己在意什么，却还说不清，身体已先有了往前的冲动。\",\n      \"key\": \"往前的冲动\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B4\"]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"because\": [],\n  \"changes\": [\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R1\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S01-1\"],\n      \"what\": \"改写\",\n      \"why\": \"保留无名的推动力和不知所等，补出方向不明带来的无着落，解释失落无从命名与身心尚未安顿的感受。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R2\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S01-2\"],\n      \"what\": \"改写\",\n      \"why\": \"保留不肯停下与害怕投入后失去的冲突，删去把不行动等同于认可现状的无依据判断，补出逼自己撑住却又想停下的心理。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R3\", \"R4\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S01-3\"],\n      \"what\": \"合并\",\n      \"why\": \"两条本是同一轮反复求证：找理由压过不舍，刚要信服又被不舍拉回。保留反复、难堪和非得想透才肯走的困境，删去重复解释与抽象的确信变陌生。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [],\n      \"now\": [\"S01-4\"],\n      \"what\": \"新增\",\n      \"why\": \"补回原线遗漏的段内变化：先前说不清的牵挂开始显得熟悉，身体先有向前的冲动而念头仍未跟上。只写心理上的熟悉感，不把珠子里的旧场景当成真实往事。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"gaps\": [\n    {\n      \"bead\": \"B4\",\n      \"why\": \"现有内容能解释既有的不舍为何逐渐显得熟悉，也能解释身体为何先有向前的冲动；但熟悉感为何像旧场景回返，以及过去无法重新成为现在的具体所指，都没有前史可依。若补出具体来历，就会把珠子的比喻写成他真实经历过的往事。\"\n    }\n  ]\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "448bfeab-aed0-4e0f-880f-a0f9ef4657ce", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T045737491168Z", "elapsed_seconds": 241.781, "completed_utc": "2026-10-29T05:01:39.283227+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "a67cb669e9c02f9e61c8c34a0d78fabe217a2bbeb2f9cffb9efb1023382bef4b", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T045737491168Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "6ba71e409ca6d2d965d62669a9d5dc5d11feefcda4a1555d3d96c108fa307564"}}}
